  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS South Africa 2024 &#x2013; Team leader DRRS Team South Durban Basin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scope of the DRRS Team&apos;s intervention is the Development of a roadmap to achieve a comprehensive flood resilience strategy for the South Durban Basin.The roadmap needs to assist eThekwini Municipality and other key stakeholders to develop and implement a strategy to reduce the local and regional flood risk to a 100-year level.For the development of the roadmap, the DRRS Team will undertake several stakeholder meetings to understand the technical, financial and institutional situation on the ground.</narrative>
  </description>
